      "created_at": "2016-08-30T21:57:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That would make sense, especially if it's somehow keeping track per board of the number of new threads and not reducing that number when a post moves boards. Then, there's no post to mark as read, so the count can't go down.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For a span of like 5 minutes today, I was seeing the same thing on this board after reading Powerhound's response, but it's cleared itself up. Weird.</p>",
