      "created_at": "2016-08-31T18:02:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>TakeWalker, in your case, does it usually jump to a post in the middle of a thread?</p><p>I know when someone edits a post, it marks it as new and makes it the first thing you click on \"X new posts\". (Which can be weird if someone posts a new message after that, or if multiple people edit their posts in a thread). And with the forum bug where edits aren't always showing up for everyone, that probably makes that case even more confusing.</p>",
